    "updated_at": "2016-04-06T18:34:25Z",
    "body": "I think it's up to you whether you think it'd be useful as four commits or one. Maybe they should be one, e.g. it's a bit weird to introduce \"create an element\" in the first commit and only start using it in the second and fourth commits. Certainly it'll look nicer as a single tweet with a nice headline like \"Add support for custom elements\" instead of these jargon-ish commit messages :).\n",
